### Variabel Lingkungan
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Ambil Katalog Buku (Pagination & Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?per_page=5&page=1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2. Cari Buku Berdasarkan Kata Kunci (Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search=Clean
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3. Filter Buku yang Hanya Memiliki Stok (Available=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?available=1&per_page=5
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4. Ambil Detail Satu Buku
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5. Ambil Daftar Kategori Referensi
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6. Ambil Daftar Penulis Referensi
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7. Ambil Riwayat Peminjaman Buku
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 8. Buat Transaksi Peminjaman Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "user_id": 3,
  "book_ids": [1, 2]
}

### 9. Ambil Detail Transaksi Peminjaman
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 10. Pengembalian Buku (Tepat Waktu / Terlambat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/1/return
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

{
  "returned_at": "2026-11-20"
}

### 11. Pelunasan Denda Keterlambatan
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/1/pay-fine
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 12. Uji Coba Error Format JSON Otomatis (Tanpa Header Accept)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 99999,
  "book_ids": []
}
